--- ARCHITECTURE (Shared-free page + protocol seam; precedent: CostSavingsPanel,
    LiveDrivetrainHealthProvider, VehicleSettingsModel) -------------------------
* The page binds an @Observable DataExportPageModel through a DataExportService
  seam (web hooks ported verbatim at the Swift call sites: useExportColumns,
  useCreateAccountExport, + useExportJobs, useVehicles, useCreateExport).
* Reads in the live adapter use the proven FlowBridge + ResourceSuccess projection
  over the real KMP ExportsStore/VehiclesStore (P1/S8). Kotlin suspend+Result
  mutation interop has NO Swift precedent in this repo (only CoreSpotlight uses
  `try await`), so to avoid fabricated interop the two write paths are injected
  closures, finalized at bootstrap on the macOS gate (the same CI-pinning the
  facade documents). The live adapter is behind `#if canImport(Shared)`.
* Navigation: added AppRoute.dataExport (pathSegment "data-export", group .system)
  so AppRouteParser resolves /data-export; DataExportRouteRegistration hosts the
  page in the route-host registry, wired in TeslaSyncApp (mirrors Settings).
* Units: bytes/counts/durations are non-unit-bearing; formatting at the display
  boundary via the pure DataExportProjection. SI rule (ADR-014) honored.

